# Public-ontology application-profile shapes are admitted here only after the
# referenced public ontology artifacts are pinned, materialized, licensed,
# and qualified. This file intentionally contains no mappings yet.
#
# Contract:
#   * sh:targetClass MUST be a public ontology class, never an urn:xaas:* class.
#   * sh:path MUST be a public RDF property.
#   * local IRIs may identify SHACL shape instances, but this pack MUST NOT
#     declare local owl:Class/rdf:Property/owl:ObjectProperty/owl:DatatypeProperty
#     vocabulary merely to make Ash generation convenient.
#   * datatype property shapes can be projected by the current generator.
#   * object-property projection is fail-closed until its Ash relationship
#     ownership/cardinality semantics are admitted explicitly.

@prefix sh: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
